        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rowland Salley, Shooter Jennings, John Prine, Chris Smither, Shawn Colvin, Robert Plant, Alison Krauss, Billy Ray Cyrus\n- Works: \"Killing the Blues\"\n- Topics: cover versions, outlaw country music, Southern rock\n\nFacts:\n- Rowland Salley's best-known song is \"Killing the Blues.\"\n- \"Killing the Blues\" has been covered by John Prine, Chris Smither, Shawn Colvin, Robert Plant, and Alison Krauss.\n- In 2015, Shooter Jennings and Billy Ray Cyrus recorded a cover of \"Killing the Blues.\"\n- Shooter Jennings was born on May 19, 1979.\n- Shooter Jennings is an American singer-songwriter.\n- Shooter Jennings has worked mainly in outlaw country music and Southern rock.",
